<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea seeks French explanation over Thomson.</title>
<headline>S.Korea seeks French explanation over Thomson.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South Korean government on Thursday jumped into the controversy over France's suspension of the sale of Thomson SA, saying it was demanding an &quot;understandable explanation&quot; from Paris.</p>
</text>
